# What Milestone 1 should NOT include

This is equally important.

Don't build yet:

```text
❌ Multi-document automatic updates
❌ Vector embeddings
❌ pgvector
❌ Elasticsearch
❌ GitHub synchronization
❌ PDF/DOCX
❌ Teams
❌ Collaboration
❌ Billing
❌ Mobile
❌ Complex permissions
❌ Decision records
❌ Automatic contradiction scanning
❌ Agent workflows
```

Those are good ideas, but none are necessary to prove the first layer.

